    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEROES ARE BACK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based strategy, tough choices, short and long term consequences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tired of mass-produced games with WEAK or BORING story ?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If so, play Heroes Project, you will get the opportunity to grow your hero and city to defeat more enemies in turn-based combat. Learn spectacular spells that allow you to turn the face of battles And get to know the intriguing and interesting history contained in 2 campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Types of Castles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Story Campaigns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 Unique units and their upgraded variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic orchestral music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Spectacular spells!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Unique and transformative hero skills!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I got angry one day, 20-year anniversary of legend, and still no good successor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We decided that if big companies can't make good continuation, we are going to do this ourselves.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEROES ARE BACK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based strategy, tough choices, short and long term consequences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tired of mass-produced games with WEAK or BORING story ?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If so, play Heroes Project, you will get the opportunity to grow your hero and city to defeat more enemies in turn-based combat. Learn spectacular spells that allow you to turn the face of battles And get to know the intriguing and interesting history contained in 2 campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Types of Castles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Story Campaigns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 Unique units and their upgraded variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic orchestral music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Spectacular spells!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Unique and transformative hero skills!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I got angry one day, 20-year anniversary of legend, and still no good successor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We decided that if big companies can't make good continuation, we are going to do this ourselves.</p>",
